- \( y_{S1}, y_{S2} \) are binary variables indicating if supplier S1 or S2 is activated.
- \( x_{S1,C1}, x_{S1,C2}, x_{S2,C1}, x_{S2,C2} \) are the quantities shipped from each supplier to each supermarket.

